<ul>
  <li>On the project's CI benchmark suite (run 42287159440, 18 scenarios): within 25 % of the better of Reflex and alien-signals on every scenario, at or ahead of it on 8; geometric mean 0.97 of the better one, 0.95 of Reflex, 0.42 of alien-signals.</li>
  <li>Reorders allocate nothing: with 256 sources rotated every pass, Quant creates and removes no dependency relations, where alien-signals relinks 255.</li>
  <li>Reflex remains faster on every reorder scenario (Quant takes 1.14–1.24 of its time).</li>
</ul>
<p class="note">The suite is this project's own. Per-scenario numbers: <a href={`${BLOB}/research/REPORT.md`}>REPORT.md (Q6)</a>; the trajectory across CI runs: <a href={`${BLOB}/research/HISTORY.md`}>HISTORY.md</a>.</p>
